# Data Science Capstone Project

## 1. Project Overview

This project presents an end-to-end data science workflow, starting from data collection and web scraping and continuing through data cleaning, wrangling, SQL analysis, exploratory data analysis, visualization, geospatial analysis with Folium, predictive modeling, and interactive dashboard development with Dash.

The main objective is to transform raw data into meaningful insights and demonstrate how data science techniques can be applied to answer practical analytical questions.

